     The shadPS4 file targets another build of 01.02: its code addresses in 0x564000-0x56bfff are
     0x10 higher and in 0x5f0000-0x609fff 0x120 lower here; data addresses match. Every ported
     address holds the expected original value (1920, 1080, 960x540, video arena 0x50000000).
     "Frame Rate Patch - 120 FPS" is ported by hand: the frame rate constant (59.94) is at 0x75dbe4
